---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content'; import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; const officers = (await getCollection('officers')).sort((a,b)=>a.data.order-b.data.order); const announcements=(await getCollection('announcements')).sort((a,b)=>b.data.date.valueOf()-a.data.date.valueOf());
---
<BaseLayout title="About AWM"><section class="section"><div class="shell"><div class="prose"><p class="kicker">About us</p><h1>AWM at the U</h1><p class="lede">We support all groups in mathematics. We are a student chapter of the Association for Women in Mathematics, and we organize things for undergraduates, graduate students, faculty, and staff.</p><h2>What we do</h2><p>Monthly socials and lunch discussions bring people together. We organize workshops to make useful knowledge easier to get hold of. The speaker series brings mathematicians from around the country to share their work and their experiences.</p><p>We also run a mentoring program for undergraduates and outreach activities with surrounding schools. Thanks to the RTG, the chapter has also hosted the BRIDGES conference for advanced undergraduates and early graduate students.</p></div><section aria-labelledby="officers"><h2 id="officers">Historical officers & committee chairs</h2><p>This is the complete roster preserved from the legacy site’s 2023–2024 section. It is a historical chapter record, not a verified current roster.</p><div class="grid three">{officers.map(officer => <article class="card"><h3>{officer.data.name}</h3><p class="eyebrow">{officer.data.role}</p>{officer.data.pronouns && <p>{officer.data.pronouns}</p>}{officer.data.term && <p class="meta">Term: {officer.data.term}</p>}{officer.data.email && <p><a href={`mailto:${officer.data.email}`}>Email {officer.data.name}</a></p>}</article>)}</div></section><section id="announcements" aria-labelledby="announcements-heading"><h2 id="announcements-heading">Chapter notes</h2><div class="grid two">{announcements.map(item => <article class="card"><p class="eyebrow"><time datetime={item.data.date.toISOString()}>{item.data.date.toLocaleDateString('en-US',{month:'long',day:'numeric',year:'numeric'})}</time></p><h3>{item.data.title}</h3><p>{item.data.summary}</p>{item.data.link && <a href={item.data.link}>{item.data.linkLabel || 'Learn more'}</a>}</article>)}</div></section></div></section></BaseLayout>
